 10. Compute opacity $\alpha_i = 1 - \exp(-\sigma_i \delta_i)$ and transmittance $T_i = \exp\left(-\sum_{j=1}^{i-1} \sigma_j \delta_j\right)$ [S1].
 11. Accumulate color: $\hat{C}(\mathbf{r}) = \sum_{i=1}^{N} T_i \alpha_i c_i$ [S1].
